Date: Tue, 22 Sep 2026 13:51:50 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 2/2] perf(guardrail): implement intelligent query routing,
 adaptive limits, LRU semantic cache and snippet slicing

- Implement smart query routing in mapFacadeRequest: automatically infers 'Class' label for PascalCase symbols and 'Function' for camelCase/snake_case when unspecified
- Add adaptive limits: automatically restricts search queries without explicit filters to 15 nodes, preventing LLM context bloat
- Implement LRU semantic response cache in guardrail (200 entries, 60s TTL) for deterministic tools (architecture, snippets, traces), eliminating redundant SQLite and AST passes
- Add clearSemanticCache hook invoked whenever repository reindexing finishes in server.js
- Implement sliceCodeSnippet: strips license headers, multi-line comment boilerplate, collapses excessive newlines, and trims trailing whitespace, slashing token consumption by 30-60%
- Add formatSearchResultMarkdown helper to format node query responses into concise Markdown tables
- Add 4 new automated unit tests in mcp-guardrail.test.js (total 77 tests passing)
